      "line": 56,
      "owner": "@beep/epistemic-server",
      "reason": "Restart regression decodes fixed commands to write history in one PGlite scope and re-read it in a second over the same dataDir; what is under test is that the data files carry history, lineage, dispositions, and live constraints across a process boundary, not schema laws."
    },
    {
      "file": "packages/epistemic/tables/test/ExecutionRecordTables.test.ts",
      "symbol": "schema-codec-tests",
