      "status": "exception",
      "ruleId": "SFV4-arbitrary-tests",
      "line": 53,
      "owner": "@beep/epistemic-tables",
      "reason": "Fixed-fixture suite: physical table and column pins, insert/select round-trips of an allowed decision, a denied decision, an outcome and a sealed pair, plus the converter failure paths (an unencodable record, a corrupted row on each ledger boundary, and the empty-message fromSchema fallback). Schema-derived property coverage for ExecutionDecisionRecord and ExecutionOutcomeRecord lives with the owning @beep/epistemic-domain value models; the table converters only project them across the persistence boundary."
    },
