      "kind": "plain-data-schema-class",
      "status": "exception",
      "owner": "@beep/chalk",
      "reason": "Keep-as-class allowlist (goals/schema-opaque-default/ops/codemod/keep-class.jsonc): Builders share one mutable state object by reference; Opaque make copies nested struct fields, S.Class keeps the reference (chalk tests: level validation and level propagation across child builders)."
