      "reason": "D4 structural-brand exception (goals/schema-opaque-default/ops/codemod/keep-class.jsonc): Chalk builder state is one mutable plain object shared by reference across a builder chain (the `level` setter mutates it in place); branded construction through make() yields immutable instances and breaks level propagation (chalk test: propagates level changes across child builders). Kept as a class (keep-class entry) with the structural brand so the original plain-object state stays assignable. Follow-up: brand nominally once the blocker above is removed."
